WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.140
After a deadly battle with Victor,

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:08.150
we welcomed the daughter of the vanquished
Demon King Gustav to our party.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.240
You're sure about this, right?

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.510
Yes.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.830
Glad to have you aboard, Sera.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.200
Yeah. Thanks for taking me in.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:45.300
I can feel how important he was to you.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:50.180
Thank you for everything, Victor!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:59.020
And so, since my Blacksmithing and
Efil's Sewing are now Rank S,

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:02.880
we're ready to show off our new creations!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:07.010
First up, Sera, whose weapon is Arondight!

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.400
See how strong it is for yourself!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.500
Arondight (Rank S)

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.220
The armor's name is Queen's Terror.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.720
Wow, great! I love it!
"Queen's Terror"!

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:20.720
Queen's Terror (Rank S)

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.710
The queen who inspires terror
in everyone! What a cool name!

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:24.540
I made the weapon out of Victor's
armor, just like you asked.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.850
You sure that's what you wanted?

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:32.490
Yes. It makes me feel like
he's fighting alongside me.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:33.650
Great.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:39.280
And for Gerard, we have the
Magic Sword Dáinsleif!

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:39.530
Magic Sword Dáinsleif (Rank S)

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:42.740
It's got the exact same dimensions
as the sword you have now,

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.150
so it shouldn't take you long to learn.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:50.580
It looks exactly the same.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.660
What about you and Efil?

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.580
You can look forward to
seeing those when we fight!

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.830
I've spent the past few
days locked in the smithy.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.860
Let me eat and sleep.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.570
I'll make us something, then.

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:11.700
Any requests, Master?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:14.850
Rice.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:18.950
I want rice.

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:22.750
Master? What's "rice"?

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:28.590
That rich scent, the glistening,
the stickiness!

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.540
It gets sweeter with every bite,

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.930
and it's loaded to the
brim with sinful carbs!

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.760
My body seeks it! I want it now!

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.010
Rice!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:51.150
Black Summoner

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.400
Kelvin, a river!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.030
There's a river!

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.030
You want to go fishing?

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.610
Fishing? What's fishing?

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.040
When we get to Toraj, let's try it!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.870
Hooray! I can't wait!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.930
One of the goals of this journey
is to keep my promise to Victor

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.980
and show Sera the world.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.800
The other is...

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:53.050
I'm looking forward to the rice, too.
Aren't you, Master?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.800
Yeah, I sure am.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:05:00.040
We're heading to the Water Country of Toraj,
a country that borders the ocean.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:05.280
Toraj is said to have a rice-like plant,
and it's a place I've wanted to go.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.420
For some reason, it wasn't too hard to
get permission from Guildmaster Leo.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:12.580
So off to Toraj we go!

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:16.970
My King, the princess appears
to have gone missing again.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.220
Oh, Melfina is...

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.170
One day after I woke up
from a night of partying,

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:28.560
I learned that the reason I couldn't summon
Melfina yet is that her class is "God."

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.840
Is there anything you can do about that?

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.900
I'll just have to use one of my avatars.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.160
My avatars are a part of me.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:40.270
I can possess them and hide
the fact that I'm a god.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.150
I'll be taking a vacation, My Lord.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.400
Again?

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:47.160
I'll go tune one of my avatars.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:49.850
If it works, you may be able to summon me!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.350
Off I go!

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:58.660
They look just like me, so you can feel
free to fall in love at first sight again!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:02.490
Farewell!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:08.060
So she's off on a trip again.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.150
Hey, Kelvin!

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.340
There's a ship! I'd love to ride on it!

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.840
Yeah, some other time.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.060
Master, about this part of the book...

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.500
Oh, that's...

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:28.870
Clotho, I think I can tell why
the princess is in such a hurry.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.380
Hey, Kelvin.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.460
I was wondering...

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:35.870
What?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:40.430
Some people have been watching us in secret.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:41.930
Yup, they sure are.

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:45.790
Don't scare me like that, mister.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.180
Hold it right there!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:01.050
Two of 'em are real beauts, ma'am!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.850
The boss will be overjoyed!

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:04.870
Who are you?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.860
We're the infamous band of thieves,

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.620
"The Black Wind."

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.680
"The Black Wind"?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.860
You know them?

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:17.040
Yes. They're a band of thieves that
became famous in Toraj a while back!

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:22.380
Supposedly a Rank A adventurer from
Trycen destroyed them, but...

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.490
Oh?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:28.430
Look, guys! They're terrified
just from hearing our names.

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:32.560
Level 25 to... a bit above 30?

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.800
Sera, I know it won't be satisfying for you,

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.840
but can you go play with them?

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:38.820
Roger that.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:44.730
No using the Arondight.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.260
What? Why not?

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.040
It'd make a mess.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.210
Fine.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.090
Back in a jiffy!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:53.780
Thanks.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.640
You want to fight us all by yourself?

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:05.290
You're from Parth, right?
You can't be any higher than Rank C.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.250
You'll regret it, missy.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:10.280
The girls will fetch a good price.
Don't hurt them too much.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.540
Got it.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.620
Let's have some fun, girlie.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.960
That's a no.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.520
Ensu!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.240
I thought I held back, too.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:24.720
But it was still too strong?

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:29.180
F-Fool! Ensu was just letting his guard down!

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:31.800
All of you, swarm her at once!

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:45.940
You want a test of brute strength now?

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.120
Sure, I'll play along.

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:54.230
Impossible!
Gilda's strength is way above 200!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:56.150
That'll do, I guess.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.890
Impossible!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:07.350
Sera's level 75.
They don't stand a chance.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.000
What's wrong?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.870
You were having so much fun a minute ago!

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:17.290
Let's have some more fun,
Miss "Mild Breeze."

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:23.130
I feel like I'm even stronger
than I was before I was sealed!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.990
It's because of the magic supply
from the summoning, right?

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:30.280
I'd love to challenge
you to a duel sometime.

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.750
Sounds good to me!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:36.420
Don't think you've won
just because you beat me!

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:39.170
Our boss is level 70!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:46.840
Hmm... Why don't you tell
us a little more about him?

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:53.110
Name: Sera
Level: 75 Title: Demon King's Daughter
HP 970/970
MP 994/994
Age: 21 | Strength 580
Race: Archdemon | Endurance 466
Sex: Female | Agility 573
Class: Arcane Pugilist | Magic 569
Luck 529
Skills:
Bloodstained (Unique Skill) | Martial Arts (S) | (A) | Flight (C) |
Detect Presence (B) | Detect Danger (B) | Detect Magic (A) | Detect Concealment (C) | Dancing (B) | Playing Instrument (B)
Assist Effects:
Demon King's Grace | Summoning/Magic Supply (S) | Concealment (S)

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:53.110
Black Summoner

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:57.820
Water
Country
of
Toraj

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:57.810
So this is the Water Country of Toraj, huh?

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.540
It's like old Japan.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:06.280
So this is the sea...

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.650
It really is water as
far as the eye can see!

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:15.700
Victor... I made it to the real sea!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.670
You promised to teach
me how to swim, didn't you?

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.150
Sera?

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.760
Hey, Kelvin!

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:25.750
What?

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.730
Teach me to swim!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.480
Okay.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:33.110
Have you ever gone swimming, Efil?

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.580
No, but I'd love to try.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:43.560
If we didn't have our stuff in the carriage,
I'd go to the beach right now.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:49.800
Thank you for your cooperation in
capturing one of the leaders of the Black Wind.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:54.500
I'm the head of the Toraj
Adventurer's Guild, Guildmaster Mist.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.990
Hello. I'm Kelvin, an adventurer.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:01.080
Leo told me all about you,

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.670
Rank A Adventurer Kelvin.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:05.900
I hope he told you good things.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:10.270
You're all he talks about as of late.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.270
That's scary in its own way!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:17.050
That's surprising.
He never lets it show around me.

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:20.450
He can be a stubborn old geezer sometimes.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.740
So the two of you...

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:27.940
It was 20 long years ago,
but Leo and I were in the same party.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:32.480
Leo was called the Analyzer.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:36.420
Only because he had a habit of
peeking at other people's statuses.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.010
He peeked at mine, too.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.100
So, about the Black Wind...

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:48.320
I've shared the information you've
acquired with the other guilds.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:54.380
I still can't believe that the party that
took down the Black Wind became them, though.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:59.820
Trycen's famous warrior, Christoph,
destroyed the Black Wind of Toraj.

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:03.230
It was a big deal when it happened.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:09.220
Yes, but now it seems they're
secretly kidnapping people

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.200
and engaging in the slave trade.

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:15.660
If we knew where they were,
I could go take them down!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:20.800
They're in Toraj right now, actually.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.180
Then we should go get them immediately—

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.060
It's not that easy.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:27.970
What do you mean?

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:33.490
Indeed, Christoph is a national hero.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:39.780
If we're not careful, it could turn into an
international incident between Toraj and Trycen.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:44.500
So we can't do a thing
despite all this proof?

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.000
Sera, calm down.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:51.020
Mist is trying to tell us that
we need to make preparations.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:54.580
Christoph's level is 70...

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:58.120
To be honest, it's hard
to get excited about that.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:01.390
If only it were 20 levels higher!

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:05.860
But I can't just do nothing...

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.000
Master?

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:09.830
Sera.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.800
You're talking using this?

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.620
Is it a secret?

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:18.640
Are your detection skills picking up
a group of four powerful adventurers?

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:20.490
Um...

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:25.350
I sense somebody relatively strong
at the entrance to the town.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:29.290
They're probably about level 50?

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.650
I'm a lucky man.

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:38.140
We'll have the heroes' party
do all the work for us!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:45.010
Name: Toya Kanzaki
Level: 53 Title: Hero from Another World
HP 753/753
MP 431/431
Age: 18 | Strength 265
Race: Human | Endurance 258
Sex: Male | Agility 269
Class: Sword Saint | Magic 264
Luck 530
Skills:
Absolute Gospel (Unique Skill) | White Magic (C) | Swordsmanship (S)
Military Leadership (B) | Dual-Wielding (C) | Amazing Luck (B)
Assist Effects:
Lightfairy's Grace | Concealment (B)

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:45.010
Black Summoner

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:48.670
There's a bandit hideout nearby?!

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:53.400
Yes. And we want your help.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:58.100
Toya, we're here to find a boat to
the Empire of Risea in the West,

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:01.390
because of what the Goddess Melfina said!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.990
We don't have time for side trips!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:08.820
There are people here who
need a hero's power!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:13.460
Part of our job is to bring peace
by solving their problems!

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:15.220
Kanzaki!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:19.470
There you go with that
"helping people" mode again, Toya.

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:22.360
Of course we need to help
people if they're in trouble!

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:25.740
That doesn't mean we have to
take every job we're offered!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.590
I did what he told me to,
but is this really okay?

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:28.870
Yes, but we can't ignore them!

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:34.960
Looks like they just entered the town.

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:40.550
Yes, if the heroes, symbols of justice,
defeated him, Trycen could hardly retaliate.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:43.250
If we have them fight the Black Wind...

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:44.430
No.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.430
There goes My King's bad habit again.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.330
Yes.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.430
Then I wouldn't get to fight anybody!

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:14.000
Mom...

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.560
It's okay, Luca.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:21.030
Shouldn't you be doing the job
the boss asked you to do, Hope?

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:23.740
Oh, yeah. About Karna?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.410
When this is done, I'll do it.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:26.660
Now, then...

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:39.890
You'll do, I guess.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:41.630
N-No!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:44.000
Please, not my daughter!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.490
The boss'll be mad you
ruined the goods again.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.480
Mom!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.630
Stop it!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.260
Don't you understand?

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:58.460
There's no sound in the world
more pleasant than a girl's scream!

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:08.300
Who the hell are you? Where did you—

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:11.400
My King, I don't like them.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.520
So these are the ones who took down Karna?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.170
Gerard.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:26.020
Thanks, mister!

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.210
Luca!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.090
Mom!

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.690
Thank you!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.780
What happened, Christoph?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.390
You called me in the middle of my vacation!

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:41.590
Karna's unit may have been wiped out
while they were out hunting slaves.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.030
What is she doing?

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:46.430
This is a top-secret mission from Trycen!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:48.770
You're being too loud, Prisra.

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:53.250
The other countries won't like
it if we're caught here!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:57.380
Trycen might even abandon us!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:00.670
Ado, you tell him!

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:02.740
Our lives are at stake!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:07.220
I just want to fight someone strong.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.130
You musclebrain!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.510
Calm down.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.360
That's why I've got Hope out investigating,
so that doesn't happen.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:19.650
We'll know what's going on soon.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.940
Quiet down! We're in the
middle of a meeting.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:32.280
H-Hope!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.090
Impossible...

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.040
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.000
You're Christoph, right?

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.220
So you're the ones who took down Karna?

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:58.940
Then, I'll be able to enjoy this.

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:02.730
Sorry, we don't actually care about you.

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:03.560
What?

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:08.940
This isn't a battle.
It's like washing a dirty plate...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.190
before the main dish arrives.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.830
Hey, something's wrong!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.480
We haven't seen anybody!

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:26.850
Mist said they sent Rank A
adventurers on ahead of us, right?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.530
Did we come to the wrong place?

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:33.460
No, we looked around,
and this is the only suspicious building.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:37.920
Setsuna, you learned Detection a
while ago. Can you sense anything?

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:44.610
There's a lot of people
in one place, further in.

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:47.860
I can't see what's past that.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:51.130
Let's head to where those people are, then.

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:54.200
We might find the ones who were kidnapped!

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.780
Agreed.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.540
This place is strange.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:03.220
There's no sign of combat. No bodies.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:07.590
Our top priority is to find someone
so we can figure out what's going on.

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:15.990
We're here.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:20.100
Finding absolutely nothing on the way here
just makes me worried what's inside.

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:22.830
Detect Danger's not picking up anything.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.450
But we have to go!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.140
I'll take the lead!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.150
Everyone, back me up!

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:30.420
Girls gotta have guts.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.840
Good luck inside.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:34.910
I'm a guy, though.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:41.850
A slime?

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.360
The kidnapped people are here, too?

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.430
Everyone, get down!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.890
I'll use the Holy Sword Wil!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.330
No!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:54.550
This is the pet of the man who saved us!

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.300
You can't bully it!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.640
The man who saved you?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.680
Luca! Hey!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:07.560
I'm sorry! She's a huge fan of
the adventurer who saved her.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:11.500
This slime was part of his party...

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.870
I see.

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:17.120
Sorry. That was my fault.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:18.700
Luca...

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.890
So, who are you?

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:23.420
Well, we're...

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.730
Wait, Toya.

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.450
We shouldn't reveal our identities...

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:30.400
The hero of Deramis, Toya Kanzaki!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.870
The hero!

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.240
The goddess saved us!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:39.330
Stop it! Please, calm down...

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:42.920
We're so sorry!
I didn't realize you were a hero!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:44.590
Sheesh...

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:50.360
I see!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.350
Did it say something?

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.250
Yeah.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:55.510
I talked to this slime,

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:58.980
and it says it was ordered to stay here and
protect the people who were kidnapped.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.970
So they have a slime as a servant?

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:04.860
They have a tamer like you, Nana,
in their party? That's rare.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:08.390
Hero, um... I have a request.

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:14.240
Would you please help the
Rank A adventurers who saved us?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:22.040
There are still dozens of bandits left.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.920
And their leaders are veteran warriors.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.510
No matter how strong they are,
they can't win alone!

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.810
Please, before it's too late!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:32.500
That door leads to the last room.

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:33.810
Okay!

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.220
Wait, Toya!

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:37.110
Don't just run in!

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.400
Did we not make it in time?

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:51.760
So these were the Rank A
adventurers who arrived first?

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.390
Their wounds are terrible...

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:54.630
They're a mess...

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:56.590
I'm sorry!

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.970
How could you do this to them?!

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:04.180
Are you the Black Wind bandits?

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:09.970
EP 06: Rice and Thieves and Heroes
